    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_47_23618-23759",
      "chapterUid": 47,
      "range": "23618-23759",
      "markText": "我现在七岁。 二〇〇一年的我，变成了什么样子？ 我变成一个很棒的女生了吗？我有男朋友了吗？ 我好期待。",
      "totalCount": 7506,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=47&rangeStart=23618&rangeEnd=23759",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=47&rangeStart=23618&rangeEnd=23759"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_46_18457-18504",
      "chapterUid": 46,
      "range": "18457-18504",
      "markText": "没有人想要被卷入命案。每个人都希望被害人与自己毫无共通之处，距离自己居住的世界愈遥远就愈放心。",
      "totalCount": 6174,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=46&rangeStart=18457&rangeEnd=18504",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=46&rangeStart=18457&rangeEnd=18504"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_38_3083-3165",
      "chapterUid": 38,
      "range": "3083-3165",
      "markText": "是要现在享乐，事后付出可怕的代价，还是立刻工作，分期处理掉麻烦？多欢乐的选择题啊。我是个劳碌命，没有选择的余地。",
      "totalCount": 5760,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=38&rangeStart=3083&rangeEnd=3165",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=38&rangeStart=3083&rangeEnd=3165"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_38_1628-1653",
      "chapterUid": 38,
      "range": "1628-1653",
      "markText": "开端总是手机。对社会记者来说，手机就像恐怖的项圈。",
      "totalCount": 4888,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=38&rangeStart=1628&rangeEnd=1653",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=38&rangeStart=1628&rangeEnd=1653"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_34_1871-1933",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "1871-1933",
      "markText": "诗织的命案发生后刚好第三年的秋天，我的女儿过世了。一场突来的事故结束了她的一生。我在工作中接到消息，甚至无法见死去的她一面。",
      "totalCount": 4732,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=34&rangeStart=1871&rangeEnd=1933",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=34&rangeStart=1871&rangeEnd=1933"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_32_2467-2494",
      "chapterUid": 32,
      "range": "2467-2494",
      "markText": "最后，比什么都更重要的是，愿诗织小姐在天之灵能够安息。",
      "totalCount": 4560,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=32&rangeStart=2467&rangeEnd=2494",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=32&rangeStart=2467&rangeEnd=2494"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_39_16482-16541",
      "chapterUid": 39,
      "range": "16482-16541",
      "markText": "“收了人家那么多礼物，才说要分手，做男人的怎么会不生气？你自己不是也拿到一堆好处了？这种男女问题，警察是不能插手的。”",
      "totalCount": 4250,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=39&rangeStart=16482&rangeEnd=16541",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=39&rangeStart=16482&rangeEnd=16541"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_34_2454-2481",
      "chapterUid": 34,
      "range": "2454-2481",
      "markText": "我为小女取的名字、往后再也无法呼唤的名字，叫作清水梓。",
      "totalCount": 4140,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=34&rangeStart=2454&rangeEnd=2481",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=34&rangeStart=2454&rangeEnd=2481"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_38_13877-13933",
      "chapterUid": 38,
      "range": "13877-13933",
      "markText": "就算是有记者询问，警方公布的死者服装也详尽过头了。“黑色迷你裙”“厚底长靴”“普拉达的背包”“古驰的手表”等等。",
      "totalCount": 4100,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=38&rangeStart=13877&rangeEnd=13933",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=38&rangeStart=13877&rangeEnd=13933"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_41_20418-20504",
      "chapterUid": 41,
      "range": "20418-20504",
      "markText": "我听着渡边的话，手机用力按在耳朵上，按到耳朵几乎发痛了。脑袋一片空白，空白的脑袋里，“拍到了”这三个字就像彩纸般漫天飞舞。拍到了拍到了拍到了拍到了拍到了拍到了拍到了拍到了！",
      "totalCount": 3948,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=41&rangeStart=20418&rangeEnd=20504",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=41&rangeStart=20418&rangeEnd=20504"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_45_18926-18975",
      "chapterUid": 45,
      "range": "18926-18975",
      "markText": "据说他说了“对不起”。但这与其说是对诗织、对被他伤害的许多人的赔罪，更像是对自己选择的人生的懊悔。",
      "totalCount": 3852,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=45&rangeStart=18926&rangeEnd=18975",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=45&rangeStart=18926&rangeEnd=18975"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_38_6515-6605",
      "chapterUid": 38,
      "range": "6515-6605",
      "markText": "人命不可能有贵贱之分，原本不管任何人怎么样遇害，都是重大事件，但现实中，不同的命案，世人的关注程度也不同。是因为媒体报道，所以民众关注，还是因为民众关注，媒体才大肆报道？我不知道。",
      "totalCount": 3626,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=38&rangeStart=6515&rangeEnd=6605",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=38&rangeStart=6515&rangeEnd=6605"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_38_7722-7767",
      "chapterUid": 38,
      "range": "7722-7767",
      "markText": "如果被害人有任何过错，他们唯一的错，就是相信这个“社会”是安全的，在那一瞬间身在那个地点。",
      "totalCount": 3392,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=38&rangeStart=7722&rangeEnd=7767",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=38&rangeStart=7722&rangeEnd=7767"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_21_774-800",
      "chapterUid": 21,
      "range": "774-800",
      "markText": "新闻上报道的全是扭曲的被害人形象，调查本身则触礁了。",
      "totalCount": 3248,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=21&rangeStart=774&rangeEnd=800",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=21&rangeStart=774&rangeEnd=800"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_39_20176-20228",
      "chapterUid": 39,
      "range": "20176-20228",
      "markText": "次日二十四日，父亲急忙带着信件去警署求助，然而负责的刑警却只是笑着说：“这纸质很不错呢，做得很用心嘛。”",
      "totalCount": 3212,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=39&rangeStart=20176&rangeEnd=20228",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=39&rangeStart=20176&rangeEnd=20228"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_21_1977-2062",
      "chapterUid": 21,
      "range": "1977-2062",
      "markText": "被害人诗织看不到今年春天的樱花，也听不到夏季的蝉鸣。往后都再也看不到、听不到了。同龄女性应该会在往后经历恋爱、结婚、生子等充满各种喜悦的人生，她的人生却在那个秋天结束了。",
      "totalCount": 3094,
      "appLink": "weread://bestbookmark?bookId=38585704&chapterUid=21&rangeStart=1977&rangeEnd=2062",
      "webLink": "https://weread.qq.com/web/reader/63332500724cc5686333355?chapterUid=21&rangeStart=1977&rangeEnd=2062"
    },
    {
      "bookmarkId": "38585704_41_9434-9456",
      "chapterUid": 41,
      "range": "9434-9456",
      "markText": "更何况穿什么衣服，能构成一个人被杀的理由吗？",
